<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.lei.unstrings ~ unstring ~ swarm-lei-unstring

`lares lei unstring --rite <rite> --branch <name> --lei <cid>` revokes a lei that still holds returns: a signed record, nothing deleted.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ unstring

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`unstring` params=`rite/kukulu branch/main lei/<cid> ~ revoke one lei`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ rite · branch · lei · face

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`rite` params=`takes/rite needs/required ~ the rite the lei grants: push, kukulu or keep`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`branch` params=`takes/name needs/required ~ the lei's branch`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`lei` params=`takes/cid needs/required ~ the lei to revoke`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/index ~ the face whose line this reads or strings, a whole count from 0`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ the row runs in the vessel, where the hand-only gate, the ward and the co-sign stand`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · hand-act-only

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`~ a missing rite, branch or lei, a stray flag, or a malformed count`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`hand-act-only` params=`~ an AI seat revoked a lei; a person runs the line`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ landed · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`landed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[lei]] ~ the record's answer`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/1 ~ the door or the vessel refused by name`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares lei unstring

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares lei unstring]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

